            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "うむ、みな元気に学園生活を\n送ってくれているようで何より。",
            "enText": "Mhm. It's nice to see the students going \nabout their daily lives with such vigor.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 6018049020870505247,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "しかし、相変わらず\n警戒されてしまっているか。",
            "enText": "However, my presence seems \nto have put some on edge.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -6052257693006266393,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "もう少し、気軽に近寄って\r\nきてくれてもよいのだが。",
            "enText": "I understand, but I do wish they'd \nfind me more approachable…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4252919302446109622,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "フジキセキを見習って\r\n手品でも覚えてみるかな……。",
            "enText": "Perhaps I should take a page from Fuji Kiseki. \nLearning magic tricks might soften my image.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
